<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1446250854"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:57.000"><div begin="15.023" end="34.805" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.023" end="18.796" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.023" end="15.613">我不</span><span begin="15.613" end="16.102">羡</span><span begin="16.102" end="16.910">慕</span> <span begin="17.710" end="18.109">太</span><span begin="18.109" end="18.796">阳</span></p><p begin="20.941" end="24.750" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.941" end="21.570">照不</span><span begin="21.570" end="22.102">亮</span><span begin="22.102" end="22.828">你</span> <span begin="23.671" end="24.750">过往</span></p><p begin="27.034" end="34.805" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.034" end="27.963">有些黑</span><span begin="27.963" end="28.811">暗</span> <span begin="29.622" end="30.502">我们</span> <span begin="32.098" end="33.294">都一</span><span begin="33.294" end="34.805">样</span></p></div><div begin="39.025" end="58.842" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="39.025" end="42.977" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.025" end="39.648">我太</span><span begin="39.648" end="40.200">嫉</span><span begin="40.200" end="40.894">妒</span> <span begin="41.605" end="42.190">时</span><span begin="42.190" end="42.977">光</span></p><p begin="44.950" end="49.033" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.950" end="45.623">能离</span><span begin="45.623" end="46.231">开</span><span begin="46.231" end="47.098">得</span> <span begin="47.697" end="48.057">大</span><span begin="48.057" end="49.033">方</span></p><p begin="50.289" end="52.590" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.289" end="51.055">不用</span><span begin="51.055" end="51.751">开</span><span begin="51.751" end="52.590">口</span></p><p begin="53.254" end="58.842" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.254" end="53.954">也就</span><span begin="53.954" end="54.712">无</span><span begin="54.712" end="55.801">需</span> <span begin="56.685" end="57.132">躲</span><span begin="